  m_text: "Candlelight\r\n\r\n\r\nGAME TEAM:\r\n\r\nArthur Motta\r\nGraphics Engineer,
    Game Designer\r\n\r\nArthur Oliveira\r\nEnvironment Artist, Texture artist\r\n\r\nCl\xE1udio
    Vin\xEDcius Soares\r\nEnvironment Artist, Level Designer\r\n\r\nDenys Gabriel
    Grossi Pereira\r\nMusic and Sound Effects Designer\r\n\r\nEnzo Rafael Ricarte\r\nGameplay
    Engineer\r\n\r\nGuilherme Dias\r\nCharacter Artist, Environment Artist\r\n\r\nGabriel
    de Castro\r\nGeneralist Artist\r\n\r\nItalo Eduardo Alves\r\nGameplay Engineer\r\n\r\nOt\xE1vio
    Oliveira\r\nProject Manager, User Interface Designer and Engineer\r\n\r\n\r\nPUC
    MINAS:\r\nOrientador e Coordenador de Trabalho de Conclus\xE3o de Curso, Projeto
    Aplicado I e Projeto Aplicado II:\r\nLu\xEDs Felipe Matsya De Aruanda Ramos Garrocho\r\n\r\nProfesors/Support:\r\nRoque
    Anderson\r\nDaniel Pinheiro Lima\r\nMarcelo LaCarreta\r\nMarcos Arrais\r\nArtur
    Martins Mol\r\nDiego Antunes\r\nAlexandre Teixera\r\nSinaide Bezerra\r\nMichelle
    Nery\r\n\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSpecial Thanks:\r\n\rour friends and family\n...
    and you, who played our game!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
